{"id":"n15206-1-7","stage":3,"title":"뛰어놀다 · 蹦跳玩耍","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15206-1-7-1","ko":"아직 밤이 늦지 않았으니까 좀 더 놀아도 돼.","zh":"现在还不是很晚，可以再玩一会儿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밤이","meaning":"夜，夜间","explanation":"밤：夜，夜间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74178","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦지","meaning":"缓慢，晚","explanation":"늦다：缓慢，晚；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64526","senseId":"2","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않았으니까","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一会儿","explanation":"좀：一会儿","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"2","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀아도","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"da9e530428ce1c2d","term":"밤","zh":"夜，夜间","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3","entryId":"74178","definition":"日落到第二天日出前的黑暗时段。","pronunciation":["밤"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"缓慢，晚","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"64526","definition":"过了合适的时候；或错过了最佳时机。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一会儿","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"时间短暂地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7e32c2579a8bc0c9b6ee.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15206-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 밖에 나가서 좀 더 뛰어놀자.","zh":"那我们到外面去多跑跑、多玩玩吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밖에","meaning":"外，外边","explanation":"밖：外，外边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"1","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가서","meaning":"出，出去","explanation":"나가다：出，出去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"1","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一会儿","explanation":"좀：一会儿","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"2","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뛰어놀자.","meaning":"蹦跳玩耍","explanation":"뛰어놀다：蹦跳玩耍；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"뛰어놀다","audio":"/audio/61aa356170db441abbb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15206","senseId":"1","lemma":"뛰어놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外，外边","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"越过线或界限的那边。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"出，出去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从某个地区或空间里移动到外部。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一会儿","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"时间短暂地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"61aa356170db441a","term":"뛰어놀다","zh":"蹦跳玩耍","audio":"/audio/61aa356170db441abbb6.mp3","entryId":"15206","definition":"到处蹦跶着玩。","pronunciation":["뛰어놀다","뛰여놀다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b06878bef55c82345634.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.097,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15206","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":113,"sequenceScore":2.9237,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那我们到外面去多跑跑、多玩玩吧。","现在还不是很晚，可以再玩一会儿。","你们家儿子怎么就不打算从爸爸背上下来呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["现在还不是很晚，可以再玩一会儿。","你们家儿子怎么就不打算从爸爸背上下来呢？","那我们到外面去多跑跑、多玩玩吧。"],"answer":2}]}
